Z||000003||hugh||10-24-2001||09:11 PM||||Now I remember movies being only 10 cents.I used to go to a movie theater called the Jumbo in Philadelphia.People would beg for pennies and when they got 10 cents would try to get in and the manager wouldn't let them.On Saturdays they had surprise bags and would give away a bike.They also had serials staring Clyde Beatty that would make you keep coming back.I'll remember more as this thread gets posts and drive you all nuts! ||||reg||3
