Z||000018||Sage||10-25-2001||12:16 AM||||Hugh;<P>Yes to all.  $6.00 would fill the tank in a 57 chevy and you could cruise all weekend.<P>Transister radios would "almost" fit in your pocket.<P>Hula hoops<P>Annette<P>Davy Crocket and Red Skelton<P>Bread-5 loaves for a buck<P>Pedal cars<P>Taking the bus downtown to a movie that you could stay in AAALLL day for a quarter.<P>This could go on forever...and we'd still forget something really important.<P>If you're as old as you feel, then I am 51 going on 11.<P>(Can't quite convince my body of that most days though.)<P><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>(edit4typo)<BR>------------------<BR>Have a good one!<p>[This message has been edited by Sage (edited 10-25-2001).]||||reg||1
