Z||000047||Raydar||10-27-2001||12:03 AM||||I was born in 57. <BR>Still remember when color TV was a big deal. <P>And remote controls. <BR>The first remote control I ever saw was mechanical. When you pressed the button it gave off a "ping" that the TV responded to. Only had four buttons.<P>Almost nobody had touch-tone phones. They were all still rotary dials.<P>And to <I>really</I> put it in perspective... The guidance system that landed the first manned spacecraft on the moon was the functional equivalent of a 486.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>I think I'll go to Spencers and buy a new Lava Light, tomorrow.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
