Z||000060||hugh||10-31-2001||07:35 PM||||Fuel dragsters are running 260mph in the 1/8 mile now,330 in the 1/4.<BR>The good cowboys rode the best looking horses and wore white hats.<BR>When I was in high school(there were only 48 states)the fashionable guys wore:<BR>High rise pants--The belt was about 6 inches below the top of the pants.<BR>Peg pants--The bottom of the legs had the opening down to about 14 inches.You had to take your shoes off and force your foot through the bottom.<BR>DA(ducks a$$) haircut--long enough on the sides to comb back and make it look like---you guessed it,a ducks a$$.<BR>box toe shoes.<BR>It was rare then to see someone with a mustache,now some of those kids have beards.They look older than me(well almost). ||||reg||3
